{"type":"block","data":{"id":"acontenttext1x1000000000000","parentId":"acontentcard100000000000000","rootId":"bcontent0000000000000000000","createdBy":"system","modifiedBy":"system","schema":1,"type":"text","title":"## How this works\n\n1. Set up a folder for the agent to work in — the app asks for one when the board is set up.\n2. Make a card and describe the task in it the way you would explain it to a person: what is needed, and how to tell it is done.\n3. Drag it into the «Brief» column — an agent picks it up, and a terminal button appears on the card: it shows what the agent is doing, and it is where you talk to it.\n4. When it finishes, the card travels on along its route by itself. What it did, it says in that same terminal.\n\nThis card can be deleted — it starts nothing.\n\nThe folder for this board is a folder of material: briefs, drafts, finished texts. The agent writes into it rather than into the card — what stays on the card is what it said about the work.","fields":{},"createAt":1785888000000,"updateAt":1785888000000,"deleteAt":0}}
{"type":"block","data":{"id":"acontentcard200000000000000","parentId":"bcontent0000000000000000000","rootId":"bcontent0000000000000000000","createdBy":"system","modifiedBy":"system","schema":1,"type":"card","title":"Announce a new feature on the blog","fields":{"contentOrder":["acontenttext2x1000000000000"],"icon":"🚀","isTemplate":false,"properties":{"acontentstatus0000000000000":"acontentidea000000000000000","acontentformat0000000000000":"acontentfmtpost000000000000"}},"createAt":1785888000000,"updateAt":1785888000000,"deleteAt":0}}
{"type":"block","data":{"id":"acontenttext2x1000000000000","parentId":"acontentcard200000000000000","rootId":"bcontent0000000000000000000","createdBy":"system","modifiedBy":"system","schema":1,"type":"text","title":"## What is needed\nThe brief first: who this is interesting to, which pain the feature takes away, what tone we speak about it in.\n\nThen a draft post of 2500–3500 characters: where a person starts, what they see, what they no longer have to do by hand.\n\n## How to tell it is done\nThe text reads aloud without stumbling and promises nothing the product has not got.","fields":{},"createAt":1785888000000,"updateAt":1785888000000,"deleteAt":0}}
{"type":"block","data":{"id":"acontentcard300000000000000","parentId":"bcontent0000000000000000000","rootId":"bcontent0000000000000000000","createdBy":"system","modifiedBy":"system","schema":1,"type":"card","title":"Monthly digest for the newsletter","fields":{"contentOrder":["acontenttext3x1000000000000"],"icon":"💌","isTemplate":false,"properties":{"acontentstatus0000000000000":"acontentidea000000000000000","acontentformat0000000000000":"acontentfmtletter0000000000"}},"createAt":1785888000000,"updateAt":1785888000000,"deleteAt":0}}
{"type":"block","data":{"id":"acontenttext3x1000000000000","parentId":"acontentcard300000000000000","rootId":"bcontent0000000000000000000","createdBy":"system","modifiedBy":"system","schema":1,"type":"text","title":"## What is needed\nPut together a short digest from the notes in the folder: 5–7 items, a line or two each, no preamble.\n\nEvery item is about what changed for the reader, not about what we did.","fields":{},"createAt":1785888000000,"updateAt":1785888000000,"deleteAt":0}}
